nt stores the number of button presses.","why_it_matters":"Use these words to explain what happens in this week\u2019s Technology work.","question":"Choose one example. Explain what its vocabulary word means in that situation.","source_title":"Weekly Technology vocabulary examples","source_url":"https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/condition"},{"id":"grade9_t3_2026_w02_part1_spark","status":"scheduled","title":"G9 T3 W02 - Online dangers - Words in use 1","spark_text":"The phishing message asks for the school-account password. The unsafe download installs malware on the computer. The ransomware locks the project files and demands money.","why_it_matters":"Use these words to explain what happens in this week\u2019s Technology work.","question":"Choose one example. Explain what its vocabulary word means in that situation.","source_title":"Weekly Technology vocabulary examples","source_url":"https://techterms.com/definition/phishing"},{"id":"grade9_t3_2026_w02_part2_spark","status":"scheduled","title":"G9 T3 W02 - Online dangers - Words in use 2","spark_text":"Keep your password private when a message asks you to share it. A separate backup provides protection against losing the only project copy.","why_it_matters":"Use these words to explain what happens in this week\u2019s Technology work.","question":"Choose one example. Explain what its vocabulary word means in that situation.","source_title":"Weekly Technology vocabulary examples","source_url":"https://techterms.com/definition/password"},{"id":"grade9_t3_2026_w03_part1_spark","status":"scheduled","title":"G9 T3 W03 - Compare and explain online risks - Words in use 1","spark_text":"Saving only one copy creates a risk of losing the project. Repeated failed logins increase our concern about the probability of an account attack. A separate backup reduces the impact of losing the working file.","why_it_matters":"Use these words to explain what happens in this week\u2019s Technology work.","question":"Choose one example. Explain what its vocabulary word means in that situation.","source_title":"Weekly Technology vocabulary examples","source_url":"https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/risk"},{"id":"grade9_t3_2026_w03_part2_spark","status":"scheduled","title":"G9 T3 W03 - Compare and explain online risks - Words in use 2","spark_text":"The repeated password requests are evidence that the message is suspicious. A separate backup provides protection against losing the only project copy.","why_it_matters":"Use these words to explain what happens in this week\u2019s Technology work.","question":"Choose one example. Explain what its vocabulary word means in that situation.","source_title":"Weekly Technology vocabulary examples","source_url":"https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/evidence"},{"id":"grade9_t3_2026_w04_part1_spark","status":"scheduled","title":"G9 T3 W04 - Explain the message risk - Words in use 1","spark_text":"The phishing message asks for the school-account password. Saving only one copy creates a risk of losing the project. Repeated failed logins increase our concern about the probability of an account attack.","why_it_matters":"Use these words to explain what happens in this week\u2019s Technology work.","question":"Choose one example. Explain what its vocabulary word means in that situation.","source_title":"Weekly Technology vocabulary examples","source_url":"https://techterms.com/definition/phishing"},{"id":"grade9_t3_2026_w04_part2_spark","status":"scheduled","title":"G9 T3 W04 - Explain the message risk - Words in use 2","spark_text":"A separate backup reduces the impact of losing the working file. A separate backup provides protection against losing the only project copy.","why_it_matters":"Use these words to explain what happens in this week\u2019s Technology work.","question":"Choose one example. Explain what its vocabulary word means in that situation.","source_title":"Weekly Technology vocabulary examples","source_url":"https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/impact"},{"id":"grade9_t3_2026_w05_part1_spark","status":"archived"},{"id":"grade9_t3_2026_w05_part2_spark","status":"archived"},{"id":"grade9_t3_2026_w06_part1_spark","status":"archived"},{"id":"grade9_t3_2026_w06_part2_spark","status":"archived"},{"id":"grade9_t3_2026_w07_part1_spark","status":"scheduled","title":"G9 T3 W07 - Project-copy risk and priority - Words in use 1","spark_text":"Keep a backup of the project in a separate location. Repeated failed logins increase our concern about the probability of an account attack. A separate backup reduces the impact of losing the working file.","why_it_matters":"Use these words to explain what happens in this week\u2019s Technology work.","question":"Choose one example. Explain what its vocabulary word means in that situation.","source_title":"Weekly Technology vocabulary examples","source_url":"https://techterms.com/definition/backup"},{"id":"grade9_t3_2026_w07_part2_spark","status":"scheduled","title":"G9 T3 W07 - Project-copy risk and priority - Words in use 2","spark_text":"Protecting the only project copy is our first priority. A separate backup provides protection against losing the only project copy.","why_it_matters":"Use these words to explain what happens in this week\u2019s Technology work.","question":"Choose one example. Explain what its vocabulary word means in that situation.","source_title":"Weekly Technology vocabulary examples","source_url":"https://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/priority"},{"id":"grade9_t3_2026_w08_part1_spark","status":"archived"},{"id":"grade9_t3_2026_w09_part1_spark","status":"scheduled","title":"G9 T3 W09 - Rehearse online-safety decisions - Words in use 1","spark_text":"Keep a backup of the project in a separate location. Repeated failed logins increase our concern about the probability of an account attack. A separate backup reduces the impact of losing the working file.","why_it_matters":"Use these words to explain what happens in this week\u2019s Techn